Package: forestData
Title: Tools for Importing Canadian Forestry Data
Description: Simplify importing of Canadian forestry data from various sources,
    including Common Attribute Schema for Forest Resource Inventories (CASFRI;
    <https://casfri.github.io/CASFRI/>), National Terrestrial Ecosystem Monitoring System (NTEMS;
    <https://opendata.nfis.org/mapserver/nfis-change_eng.html>),
    National Ecosystem Framework for Canada
    (<https://sis.agr.gc.ca/cansis/nsdb/ecostrat/gis_data.html>), and others.
URL: https://github.com/FOR-CAST/forestData
Date: 2024-03-20
Version: 0.0.1
